    "code_execution": "Run submitted code in a network-disabled sandbox with time and memory limits.",
    "epistemic_rule": "Model count is not an evaluation signal. Score the submitted result against criteria and evidence.",
    "reasoning_boundary": "Evaluate conclusions, concise rationale, evidence, assumptions, tests, and artifacts. Hidden chain-of-thought is neither requested nor scored."
  },
